{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Chat — MCP Demo{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <h1>Chat</h1>
    <p class="lede">
        The other side of the demo: this application as an MCP <em>host</em>. The agent below has no
        tools of its own — everything it can do it borrows from the servers on the right, over the
        same protocol a desktop host would use, and it reaches them by spawning
        <code>bin/console mcp:server</code> exactly as Claude Desktop does.
    </p>

    {{ component('chat') }}
{% endblock %}
